      "html": "<p>UK GDPR limits sending personal data outside the UK without safeguards. Inside the UK and EU it is generally fine.</p><p>So ask any tool: where does the data sit?</p><p>Quickler keeps all data on Hetzner servers in Germany (EU). It is registered with the Information Commission, ZC124993. A Data Processing Agreement is available on request.</p>"
    },
