      "heading": "Tell people what you collect",
      "html": "<p>Tell people how you use their data, at or before you collect it. Say who you are, why, what for, how long you keep it, and how they can use their rights.</p><p>A short paragraph on the job sheet, or a link to your privacy policy, is enough. The Information Commission has templates. Want to see it in action? <a href=\"/pages/demo.html\">See how it works.</a></p>"
